==Trivia==
* The episode's title may reference the phrase "ramping it up".
* This episode begins the four-part [[Pokémon Summer Academy]] arc.
* [[Summer Vacation Fan Club]] is used as background music.
* None of [[James]]'s Pokémon appear in this episode or at any time during the Summer Academy arc.
* {{TRT}} doesn't appear in their standard uniforms, blast off, or recite their {{motto}} in this episode and throughout the rest of the Summer Academy arc.
** However, they do mumble the first lines of their motto while they are sleeping.
* The three teams' names come from the first [[Pokémon games]] {{3v2|Red|Green|Blue}}.
* This episode, along with the other episodes in the Summer Academy arc, were adapted into the book {{book|Pokémon Academy}}.

===Errors===
* When {{an|Dawn}} first sends out {{p|Grimer}}, her {{TP|Dawn|Piplup}} is not on her head. After Grimer is sent out, Piplup is back on her head.
